{"id":"vd-a1-bubbles-the-fish","level":"a1","n":10,"title":{"en":"Can I Take Bubbles Home?","vi":"Em mang Bubbles về nhà được không ạ?"},"summary":"Trước kỳ nghỉ, Noah xin cô Kerr cho mang chú cá của lớp về chăm — và phải hứa vài điều.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-bubbles-the-fish","level":"a1","title":{"en":"Bubbles the Fish","vi":"Chú cá Bubbles"}},"scene":{"background":"classroom","props":[{"id":"fishbowl","x":800}]},"cast":{"noah":{"name":{"en":"Noah","vi":"Noah"},"look":"boy","x":520,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#6B4A32","skin":"#E9B896","skinShade":"#D49E7A","top":"#F2C14E","topShade":"#D9A933","collar":"#D9A933"}},"kerr":{"name":{"en":"Mrs. Kerr","vi":"Cô Kerr"},"look":"woman","x":1150,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#8C6A4A","glasses":true,"top":"#5E9E7A","topShade":"#4B8765"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"noah","en":"Mrs. Kerr, can I ask a question?","vi":"Cô Kerr ơi, em hỏi một câu được không ạ?","ipa":["ˈmɪsɪz","kɝ","kæn","aɪ","æsk","ə","ˈkwɛstʃən"],"start":0.554,"end":3.204,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.972],[2,1.697],[3,1.924],[4,2.066],[5,2.435],[6,2.52]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"Of course, Noah.","vi":"Tất nhiên rồi, Noah.","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","ˈnoʊə"],"start":3.994,"end":5.284,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,3.994],[1,4.1],[2,4.782]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"Can I take Bubbles home for the holiday?","vi":"Em mang Bubbles về nhà trong kỳ nghỉ được không ạ?","ipa":["kæn","aɪ","teɪk","ˈbʌbəlz","hoʊm","fɔɹ","ðə","ˈhɑləˌdeɪ"],"start":6.074,"end":8.574,"expression":"thinking","gesture":"point","prop":"fishbowl","timing":[[0,6.074],[1,6.242],[2,6.37],[3,6.782],[4,7.251],[5,7.62],[6,7.819],[7,7.918]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"Hmm. Can you feed him every day?","vi":"Ừm. Em cho cá ăn mỗi ngày được không?","ipa":["hm","kæn","ju","fid","hɪm","ˈɛvɚi","deɪ"],"start":9.364,"end":11.994,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,9.364],[1,10.611],[2,10.81],[3,10.938],[4,11.165],[5,11.336],[6,11.606]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"Yes, two times a day!","vi":"Được ạ, hai lần một ngày!","ipa":["jɛs","tu","taɪmz","ə","deɪ"],"start":12.784,"end":14.664,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,12.784],[1,13.432],[2,13.702],[3,14.171],[4,14.284]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"And can you clean the water on Saturday?","vi":"Thế thứ Bảy em thay nước bể được không?","ipa":["ənd","kæn","ju","klin","ðə","ˈwɔtɚ","ɑn","ˈsætɚdi"],"start":15.454,"end":17.414,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,15.454],[1,15.568],[2,15.753],[3,15.866],[4,16.15],[5,16.264],[6,16.605],[7,16.761]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"Yes, I can. My mom can help me.","vi":"Được ạ. Mẹ em giúp em được ạ.","ipa":["jɛs","aɪ","kæn","maɪ","mɑm","kæn","hɛlp","mi"],"start":18.204,"end":22.154,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,18.204],[1,18.844],[2,19.057],[3,20.527],[4,20.782],[5,21.265],[6,21.493],[7,21.848]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"OK. Yes, you can take him.","vi":"Được. Em mang cá về nhé.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","jɛs","ju","kæn","teɪk","hɪm"],"start":22.944,"end":26.174,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,22.944],[1,24.453],[2,25.177],[3,25.348],[4,25.532],[5,25.831]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"Thank you! May I take his food, too?","vi":"Em cảm ơn cô! Em mang cả thức ăn của bạn ấy về được không ạ?","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","meɪ","aɪ","teɪk","hɪz","fud","tu"],"start":26.964,"end":30.654,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,26.964],[1,27.234],[2,28.605],[3,28.846],[4,28.988],[5,29.315],[6,29.556],[7,30.253]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"Yes. Here you are. Not too much!","vi":"Được. Của em đây. Đừng cho ăn nhiều quá nhé!","ipa":["jɛs","hiɹ","ju","ɑɹ","nɑt","tu","mʌtʃ"],"start":31.444,"end":36.054,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,31.444],[1,33.01],[2,33.322],[3,33.535],[4,34.97],[5,35.311],[6,35.495]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"Can I take the fishbowl to my bedroom?","vi":"Em để bể cá trong phòng ngủ được không ạ?","ipa":["kæn","aɪ","teɪk","ðə","ˈfɪʃˌboʊl","tu","maɪ","ˈbɛˌdɹum"],"start":36.844,"end":39.194,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,36.844],[1,36.988],[2,37.116],[3,37.443],[4,37.585],[5,38.238],[6,38.38],[7,38.565]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"Your bedroom? Why?","vi":"Trong phòng ngủ á? Sao thế?","ipa":["jɔɹ","ˈbɛˌdɹum","waɪ"],"start":39.984,"end":42.174,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,39.984],[1,40.136],[2,41.706]]},{"speaker":"noah","en":"We have a cat. His name is Tiger.","vi":"Nhà em có một con mèo. Nó tên là Tiger.","ipa":["wi","hæv","ə","kæt","hɪz","neɪm","ɪz","ˈtaɪɡɚ"],"start":42.964,"end":46.454,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,42.964],[1,43.102],[2,43.372],[3,43.486],[4,44.97],[5,45.254],[6,45.638],[7,45.851]]},{"speaker":"kerr","en":"Oh! Then yes, you can. Close the door!","vi":"Ồ! Vậy thì được. Nhớ đóng cửa nhé!","ipa":["oʊ","ðɛn","jɛs","ju","kæn","kloʊz","ðə","dɔɹ"],"start":47.244,"end":52.214,"expression":"surprised","react":{"noah":"happy"},"timing":[[0,47.244],[1,48.639],[2,48.923],[3,49.548],[4,49.733],[5,51.253],[6,51.622],[7,51.764]]}],"words":[{"id":"take","en":"take","ipa":"teɪk","vi":"lấy; mang; mất (thời gian)","level":0},{"id":"feed","en":"feed","ipa":"fid","vi":"cho ăn; nuôi; thức ăn chăn nuôi","level":0},{"id":"home","en":"home","ipa":"hoʊm","vi":"nhà; quê hương; về nhà","level":0},{"id":"food","en":"food","ipa":"fud","vi":"thức ăn; đồ ăn; thực phẩm","level":0},{"id":"clean","en":"clean","ipa":"klin","vi":"sạch; lau dọn; làm sạch","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Xin phép","pattern":"Can I…, please? · May I…? · Yes, you can. · No, you can't. · Of course.","explain":"Xin phép làm gì: \"Can I + động từ…, please?\" — \"May I…?\" lịch sự hơn. Đồng ý: \"Yes, you can.\" / \"Of course.\" Từ chối: \"No, you can't. Sorry.\"","keys":["can i","may i","yes, you can","of course","no, you can't"],"lines":[0,1,2,7,8,10,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-bubbles-the-fish.mp3","v":"bd73a7eaba","duration":53.304,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}